      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GO WHISKEY GO (5) slotted in just off the lead from the wide box before lifting strongly to score (30.24) at Q Parklands in a Maiden over 520m. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from four starts. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. ON A ROLL (1) flew the lids last start and led throughout to register his maiden win by 3 lengths at this track over 350m (19.48). Boxed well here. Harder here but expected to feature again. BOMBASTIC LOLA (7) broke a string of placings finishing in the money two on end before a last start sixth (20.09) at this track. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from five attempts. Expected to give a good account. HARD STYLE MISS (2) has been in the money at her last two runs, most recently when third (17.07) in a Grade 6 over 300m at this track.",
